<p>
    <strong>Core Gameplan:</strong> Elves is a very favorable matchup. Once
    the <a
        role="button" tabindex="0"
        class="card-hover"
        data-card-name="Opalescence">Opalescence</a
    > plus <a
        role="button" tabindex="0"
        class="card-hover"
        data-card-name="Parallax Wave">Parallax Wave</a
    > lock is down, their whole board gets exiled for good. Use your early <a
        role="button" tabindex="0"
        class="card-hover"
        data-card-name="Swords to Plowshares"
        >Swords to Plowshares</a
    > only on their mana dorks (<a
        role="button" tabindex="0"
        class="card-hover"
        data-card-name="Priest of Titania">Priest of Titania</a
    > or <a
        role="button" tabindex="0"
        class="card-hover"
        data-card-name="Rofellos, Llanowar Emissary">Rofellos</a
    >). Elves can come out of the gates fast, but if you make it to Turn 4
    and stabilize, the lock is impossible for them to beat.
</p>
<p>
    <strong>Sideboard Strategy:</strong> Cut <a
        role="button" tabindex="0"
        class="card-hover"
        data-card-name="Tsabo's Web">Tsabo's Web</a
    > unless they're running non-basic mana disruption like
    <a
        role="button" tabindex="0"
        class="card-hover"
        data-card-name="Rishadan Port">Rishadan Port</a
    > or <a
        role="button" tabindex="0"
        class="card-hover"
        data-card-name="Wasteland">Wasteland</a
    >. You can also trim a <a
        role="button" tabindex="0"
        class="card-hover"
        data-card-name="Meddling Mage">Meddling Mage</a
    > to make room for more reactive cards. Bring in extra
    spot removal (<a
        role="button" tabindex="0"
        class="card-hover"
        data-card-name="Swords to Plowshares"
        >Swords to Plowshares</a
    >), a sweeper (<a
        role="button" tabindex="0"
        class="card-hover"
        data-card-name="Wrath of God">Wrath of God</a
    >), and <a
        role="button" tabindex="0"
        class="card-hover"
        data-card-name="Seal of Cleansing">Seal of Cleansing</a
    > to answer free spells they bring in like <a
        role="button" tabindex="0"
        class="card-hover"
        data-card-name="Reverent Silence">Reverent Silence</a
    >.
</p>
